{
  "slug": "ag2-claude-plugins",
  "name": "Ag2 Claude Plugins",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code plugin marketplace for building AG2 (AutoGen) agents and multi-agent workflows. Includes 5 plugins: agent scaffolding (ConversableAgent + A2A server wiring), workflow patterns (two-agent chat, sequential, group chat, nested chat), tool building (function tools + API connectors), agent code review (prompt quality, security, tool contracts), and architecture guidance (pattern selection, system prompt engineering). Apache-2.0 licensed.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install ag2-claude-plugins@claude-community` from `ag2ai/ag2-claude-plugins`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin marketplace for building AG2 (AutoGen) based agents, multi-agent workflows, and A2A services.\n\nA Claude Code plugin marketplace for building AG2 (AutoGen) agents and multi-agent workflows. Includes 5 plugins: agent scaffolding (ConversableAgent + A2A server wiring), workflow patterns (two-agent chat, sequential, group chat, nested chat), tool building (function tools + API connectors), agent code review (prompt quality, security, tool contracts), and architecture guidance (pattern selection, system prompt engineering). Apache-2.0 licensed.",
